\end{aligned}

The ratio will be

\frac{\lambda_1}{\lambda_2}=\frac{\sqrt{2 m}}{\sqrt{m}}=\frac{\sqrt{2}}{1}

The ratio of de-Broglie wavelength is $\sqrt{2}: 1$.

