Equating the coefficient, we obtain

\begin{aligned}
a^3-3 a b^2 & =a \text { and } b^3-3 a^2 b=b \\
\Rightarrow a\left(a^2-3 b^2\right) & =a \text { and } b\left(b^2-3 a^2\right)=b \\
\Rightarrow \quad & a^2-3 b^2=1 \\
